  stepOut: `Step out of view… {n}`, capturing: `Recording the background… stay out of view`, capDone: `Done! You can come back into view.`,
  greenNote: `Stand in front of a plain background (e.g. a green screen) and click "Pick the background colour". Wherever that colour is in the picture, you see the new background.`,
  camFirst: `Switch your camera on first.`,
  boothNote: `For a booth or expo: the camera learns by itself what the background looks like, even while people walk by. Everything that differs from it stays visible, also people far away. Fix the camera firmly in place.`,
  aiHelps: `The recognition model is helping.`, aiFail: `The recognition model could not be loaded (no internet?).`,
  aiLoading: `Loading the recognition model…`, boothOnlyLearned: `It now works with the learned background only.`,
  starting: `Starting…`, aiTryPlate: `Try "fixed background only".`,
  aiNote: `Recognises one or a few people close to the camera, as in video calls. For people further away: choose "booth".`,
  plateOk: `Everything that differs from the recorded background stays visible. Move "Sensitivity" up if parts of you disappear, down if patches of the room remain.`,
