  loading: `Loading…`, bdFail: `The picture could not be loaded.`, bdBadFile: `This file could not be read as a picture.`,
  shotNoteDir: `Photos are saved here without asking. Only after opening the page does the browser ask once whether it may write in this folder (choose "Allow on every visit").`,
  shotNoteDl: `Photos go to Downloads through the browser. Does a "Save as" window appear for every photo? Then choose a folder above (for example a new folder inside Downloads: the browser does not allow Downloads itself): the page then saves the photos itself, without asking.`,
  shotNoteNoPick: `This browser saves photos in the downloads folder. If a "Save as" window appears for every photo, switch that off in the browser's settings (or use Chrome or Edge and choose a folder).`,
  qrNoteOk: `Photos are kept online for 24 hours via a secret link and then deleted. Key Q or the "QR" button bottom right shows recent QR codes again.`,
